      <bpmn:userTask id="W2356_Task4" name="Marketing Analyst mystery-shops the 4–5 competitor stores (the big-box…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Marketing Analyst mystery-shops the 4–5 competitor stores (the big-box home-improvement competitors in BuildRight&#x27;s markets): evaluates their sample-display quality, variety, digital integration, customer experience; compares to BuildRight&#x27;s program; identifies gaps and best practices to adopt
Responsible (R): Marketing Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 3–5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2356_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2356_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
