      <bpmn:userTask id="W2357_Task4" name="VP Merchandising reviews the emerging display technologies (VR showroom…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Merchandising reviews the emerging display technologies (VR showroom, 3D-printed samples on demand, AI color matching from a phone photo) and the program&#x27;s current performance (from W2353 ROI); evaluates the technology investments against the ROI and customer-demand evidence (W2354); recommends the technology roadmap; presents to the Executive Committee
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising / CIO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 3–5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2357_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2357_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
